/* ===== RELIGIOUS STUDIES · BURMESE (faith pack, July 2026) =====
   PRIMARILY FOR BURMESE PEOPLE to learn about Jesus — Burmese is the primary
   language everywhere (titles, story text, explanations), with English the
   quiet second line. Mirrors faith/ne.js: the same two stories, the same
   10+10 big-moment sections, the same shared scene art. Deliberately
   Christian (the secular-content rule does NOT apply in faith mode). Content
   register: rich storytelling for the un-churched reader — every person,
   place and church-word introduced in-story on first use (Adam & Eve, Eden,
   Noah, Abraham, sacrifice, the prophets, exile, disciples, Mary Magdalene).
   Paraphrase only — no Bible-translation text copied; references name the
   passages retold.
   Vocabulary: ဘုရားသခင် (God), ယေရှု (Jesus), သခင် (Lord), အပြစ် (sin),
   ယုံကြည်ခြင်း (faith), ချစ်ခြင်း (love), ကယ်တင်ခြင်း (salvation),
   ကယ်တင်ရှင် (Rescuer), သတင်းကောင်း (gospel), လက်ဝါးကပ်တိုင် (cross),
   သန့်ရှင်းသောဝိညာဉ်တော် (Holy Spirit), ကတိ (promise), ပဋိညာဉ် (covenant),
   မိတ်သဟာယ (fellowship), ပရောဖက် (prophet), တပည့် (disciple), ယဇ်
   (sacrifice), ပြည်နှင်ဒဏ် (exile). Register: honorific verb forms for
   God/Jesus (ဖန်ဆင်းတော်မူသည်/မိန့်တော်မူသည်/ကြွလာတော်မူသည်) as in Burmese
   church usage. Romanization loosely follows the Burmese course scheme in
   lang/my.js (ASCII, pronounced form; th reserved for သ). Native strings
   must avoid the chars \u0027 \u0022 < > \ (they ride inline onclick
   handlers).
   FONT: Burmese reordering vowels/medials need Noto Sans Myanmar; index.html
   already covers .deva and the :root[data-lang="my"] prose rule.
   IMPORTANT: keep paras[i][0] AND note[0] byte-stable once audio exists —
   clips in audio-myf/ are hashed from these exact strings. Regenerate with
     osascript -l JavaScript extract_audio_strings.js myf
     python3 generate_audio.py --lang myf
   Scene art is shared with the Nepali pack (language-independent scene
   emblems — scenes and symbols only, no depictions of God or of Jesus'
   face). */

